 9
Create a Procedure GET_EMP that accepts
EMPNO (IN),
ENAME (OUT),
SAL (OUT).

Handle the required exceptions.
Call the procedure using SQL*Plus session variables.
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------

sql> CREATE OR REPLACE PROCEDURE GET_EMP
(
     P_EMPNO IN EMP.EMPNO%TYPE,
     P_ENAME OUT EMP.ENAME%TYPE,
     P_SAL   OUT EMP.SAL%TYPE
)
IS
BEGIN

     SELECT ENAME,SAL
     INTO P_ENAME,P_SAL
     FROM EMP
     WHERE EMPNO=P_EMPNO;

EXCEPTION

     WHEN NO_DATA_FOUND THEN
          P_ENAME:='NOT FOUND';
          P_SAL:=0;

     WHEN OTHERS THEN
          P_ENAME:='ERROR';
          P_SAL:=0;

END;
/

